          "lessonId": "p1-b1-l20",
          "reminder": "For each definite integral, subtract the value at the lower limit from the value at the upper limit."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "solution": "<p>Split at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#x0222B;</mo><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007C;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#x0222B;</mo><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#x0222B;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>.</p><p>The first is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></math>. The second is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x02212;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>.</p><p>The sum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>: <strong>F.</strong></p>",
